    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2239990/extras/4fc655fb4a874f78475b7ddbc872cdf9.poster.avif?t=1746917110\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2239990/extras/4fc655fb4a874f78475b7ddbc872cdf9.webm?t=1746917110\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2239990/extras/4fc655fb4a874f78475b7ddbc872cdf9.mp4?t=1746917110\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story &amp; Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Love n Dream 3</strong> invites you to step into the shoes of David as you embark on a captivating journey to the enigmatic land of Zenyh City. This immersive role-playing adventure combines exploration, puzzle-solving, and character development to create a truly unique experience. Interact with the environment, solve challenges and puzzles, and enhance Dravid's talents and perks, all of which will play a crucial role in your dating encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 unique gorgeous girls</strong> with different personalities, preferences, and backgrounds. You will experience their story, life, and so on. And various interactions follow up with the character.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2239990/extras/e356a603ada41651dee2606a439e7e46.avif?t=1746917110\" /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Fusion of Medieval and Sci-Fi Worlds:</strong> Experience a unique universe where the ancient meets the futuristic, blending the best of both worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Match-3 Puzzles:</strong> Make the right decisions 